    audio_url: null,
    passage_text: "<h3 class=\"font-bold text-base mb-2 text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100\">Gasgo Propane Tank Exchange</h3>\n<p class=\"mb-3\">You have chosen a safe and <strong>(135) _______</strong> way to obtain fuel for your stoves, grills, heaters, fireplaces, or other devices. Simply follow the directions <strong>(136) _______</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"mb-3\">When your tank runs out of propane, take it to our store and leave it on one of the clearly marked green shelves outside the store. <strong>(137) _______</strong>. Then, pay the cashier inside the store for a fresh tank of propane. Next, the cashier or another staff member will accompany you to the outdoor exchange area. The staff person will give you a full tank to take home and provide help if you have multiple tanks to carry. Follow the instructions on the tank to connect it to your device.</p>\n<p class=\"mb-3\">Be sure to visit us again when you need a <strong>(138) _______</strong>.</p>",
    transcript_segments: null,
